<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:30:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于市场恶化，凯斯基础设施部门暂停债券发行</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours</link><description>金融市场状况的恶化正在阻止一家新的加拿大发行人按计划出售债券，即使有该国最重要的养老金管理公司之一的支持。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours'&gt;由于市场恶化，凯斯基础设施部门暂停债券发行&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Caisse’s Infrastructure Arm Pauses Bond Sale as Market Sours&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/la-caisse-s-infrastructure-arm-pauses-bond-sale-as-market-sours</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:34:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stock Futures Signal Gains, Oil Climbs Again: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</link><description>澳大利亚通过了一项法律，要求液化天然气出口商将多达五分之一的供应量保留给国内市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters'&gt;澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Passes Gas Reserve Law in Upset to LNG Exporters&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:31:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</link><description>随着投资者纷纷转向避险资产以及流行的套利交易瓦解，墨西哥比索正面临五年来最长的连续下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind'&gt;套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Peso in Worst Losing Streak in Years on Carry Unwind&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:07:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>